  "details": "Although I've already received an answer from support regarding this issue, I wanted to create a post here so others that may be experiencing it have something to refer to.\n\nUnder normal circumstances, while playing the game logged in through Steam, the option to upgrade your account is suppose to be present in the settings menu. However, what's in place of where the button should be, is the Steam account name and tag, displayed as if I were logged in with a VRChat account.\n\nThe initial occurrence of this problem was following the 2018.4.4 update of the game. I do not know if this particular issue is strictly limited to certain accounts or if it affects the playerbase at random to a slightly larger extent. I've attached a screenshot to show the issue from my end.",
